5204,EQ ID 5204,General Maintenance ( GRAB BARS ),Grab Bars,17602,11/06/2025,4. Prod Continuing but Affected Equipment stopped,The bar sealer between Line 1 and Line 3.5 (Gamco) was having issues sealing the plastic around the bars. It would not seal and cut through the plastic enough for the bar to be sent through the oven to shrink the plastic further. Attempts were made to adjust the sealers sit time which did help but changing the rate from 0.8 secs to 2.75 secs worked but is not adequate. We believe there is residual plastic stuck to the blade and needs to be removed or there is something with the teflon tape.,Closed and Completed,0,0,Nick,Maintenance,0,10/02/2025 12:00 AM,,[]
